                        <h1>About Documents</h1>

                        <p>We provide a document resource for our members. Please use this resource to make documents available to other members.</p>

                        <p>All supported documents will remain available on the platform for the selected time period you like.</p>

                        <h1>Doc Submittal</h1>

                        <p>Please follow the help articles that are available in the knowledge craddle to upload your documents for projects.</p>

                        <h1>Doc Retrieval</h1>

                        <p>Current members are able to search for and retrieve any documents that have been made available to other members.</p>

                        <h1>Doc Display</h1>

                        <p>For documents on the platform that are useful or general purpose documents please use this area for current documents.</p>

